Feature: One typed strategy surface with conditional proposals
  Plan checks cover structure and full-domain check with replay qualifies programs.
  Owner answers pass through the existing confirmation gate without an MCP answer path.

  @atdd-loop-strategy-algebra
  Scenario: Type-check closed plans and require conforming execution prefixes
    Given a closed registry of typed operations and bounded sequence, branch and repeat plans
    When a plan is checked before execution and its macro-step trace after execution
    Then missing inputs cannot manufacture goal artifacts
    And an undeclared or reordered step is refused
    And a stopped execution may conform as an early prefix without reaching the goal
    And independent type and trace comparison stubs must fail their negative controls

  @atdd-loop-strategy-cases
  Scenario: Assemble learned cases and check the full domain before export
    Given an immutable full-domain reference and an exactly bound complete learn corpus
    When greedy cover and case splits compose pieces with committee and region-guided questions
    Then every emitted program crosses transform check and matched receipt replay
    And a sampled-fit program wrong at an unasked input is refuted without export
    And incomplete learning and query exhaustion are inconclusive with no attempt
    And independent tables, questions and region counts agree with the Rust report

  @atdd-loop-strategy-diagnose
  Scenario: Propose minimal weak-fault explanations and the most balanced internal probe
    Given a fixed Boolean circuit, an input vector and supplied wire measurements
    When minimal explanations include every allowed weak-fault wire vector
    Then the proposed unmeasured internal wire minimizes the largest prediction bucket
    And both buckets count an explanation that permits either value
    And healthy, masked and inconsistent observations grant no actual-fault authority
    And every planted diagnosis or bucket mismatch fails the independent comparison

  @atdd-loop-strategy-readings
  Scenario: Ask the owner only when finite readings change a conditional answer
    Given bounded finite interpretations and a Boolean background
    When equivalent readings collapse and every reading combination is answered
    Then a question is proposed only when interpretations change an answer
    And a missing intended reading is not inferred
    And only the existing owner gate can filter a freshly bound reading question
    And a model answer or stale binding changes no confirmed reading
    And a budget stop produces no partial answer or accepted program
    And both ZAL surfaces round trip every named mode
